@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FCFCFA
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
title UML Sequence — Governed Operational Learning (G8–G9)

actor Engineer
participant "Evidence Store" as EV
participant "Data Release\nManifest Service" as DRM
participant "Human Gate\nService" as Gate
participant "Learning Proposal\nBuilder" as LP
actor "Industrial Expert" as Expert

Engineer -> EV: Select evidence and declare sourceType

alt sourceType = customer-telemetry
  Engineer -> DRM: Define immutable lot, purpose and controls
  DRM -> Gate: Request G8 customer/data-owner decision
  Gate --> DRM: Approved, rejected or conditional G8 disposition
  DRM --> EV: Authorized lot reference and digest
else sourceType = pilot-testbed-evidence
  Engineer -> Gate: Record justified G8 not-applicable disposition
else sourceType = synthetic-evidence
  Engineer -> Gate: Record justified G8 not-applicable disposition
end

EV -> LP: Typed evidence references and applicability context
LP -> LP: Draft falsifiable, reversible update proposal
LP -> Gate: Request G9 expert disposition
Gate -> Expert: Evidence, confounders and safety margins
Expert --> Gate: Approve, reject, condition or request evidence
Gate --> LP: Attributable G9 disposition

alt G9 approved
  LP -> Expert: Version new reversible expert baseline
else rejected or conditional
  LP -> Expert: Retain baseline and record rationale/actions
end

note over EV,Expert
sourceType is closed: customer-telemetry,
pilot-testbed-evidence or synthetic-evidence.
Every learning proposal triggers G9;
only customer telemetry triggers G8.
end note
@enduml
